   "en": "The code is crm.py ported to JavaScript line by line; SQLite and the chat are simulated in page memory, and the logic was checked against recorded answers from a real Python server (including the chat down, with a real refused connection). Leads, companies and e-mails are fictional (.example). Nothing is sent."
